### Microfrontend Example using React to embed Still.js Application

2 examples/samples are provided in here: 

The `react-still-local` is an implementation where the whole Still.js folder structure is inside the React app.

The `still-react-demo` is an implementation using the CDN.

#### Running

1. Enter to the in the project which you want to run
`cd react-still-local`

<br>

2. Install the dependencies
`npm i`

<br>

3. Run the react application
`npm run dev`

<br>

And that's it.